        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>5,967 churn events involving customers acquired prior to 2023 have been excluded:
their acquisition channel is unknown, making it impossible to correctly map them to specific channels.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='MonthlyPerformance' name='federated.1mopqmq1vgehl21eertkv130iey3' />
